# Cell: ArcRwLock · String · concat · spawn-sync · pre-fix ICE 101 ·
# post-fix `ab\nab`
#
# Part of the shared-var-decl class-fix fixture net (Core #11/#12). Pins the
# ArcRwLock arm at src/ir/lowering/stmts/mod.rs:1764 distinctly from the
# ArcMutex arm (:1813) and the ArcOnly arm (:1709). The `spawn reader(&s)` +
# `t.await()` + `with s:` shape drives CFA to ArcRwLock strategy.

async void reader(String &s):
    print(s)

async void main():
    shared(rwlock) String s = "a" + "b"
    Task[void] t = spawn reader(&s)
    t.await()
    with s:
        print(s)
